  <HediffDef ParentName="EH_ElementalHeartHediffBase">
    <defName>EH_HellFlameIncarnate</defName>
    <label>Hell Flame Incarnate</label>
    <description>Hell Flame Incarnate: the third Flame form, equal to Celestial and Thunder Incarnate in core power. Seven free skills: Hellscar Crescent, Ashen Pursuit, Infernal Waltz, Ruinous Phoenix, Hellfire Reversal, Furnace Dominion and Sovereign's Pyre. Reversal leaps away and counter-rushes when two or more enemies pressure the caster. Hellbrands are capped at three per caster; finishers consume them for a bounded impact bonus. Auto Combat also uses its larger offensive forms against a lone evolved rival or sufficiently branded enemy. Ordinary successful melee dodges have a 50% counter chance, with a two-second cooldown. Phoenix and Furnace use sovereign-tier strike coefficients. Consuming three Hellbrands empowers that victim's finisher by 20% and grants two seconds of 20% additional protection. Infernal Resolve reduces electrical-shock chance and duration by 75%. Moving 650%, Consciousness 200%, Manipulation 300%, Sight/Hearing 250%, +75 mood, x3.2 melee damage, 0.04 incoming damage and rapid recovery. Fire/heatstroke immunity. Shared 20% damage tuning applies once to eligible packets. Black suit/cape, indestructible Ashreign katana, hollow infernal halo and subtle back aura while transformed and drafted. Bestow grants ordinary Flame. Right-click utility cycles Hell Step Auto, Manual, Hell Travel. Shift-left-click Step chooses any safe map cell. Travel creates a loadable living transport for the carrier, companions and cargo, with native settlement and Tower arrival actions. Abilities respect Non-lethal and do not create permanent terrain or repeating damage fields.</description>
    <comps>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_FlameRecovery">
        <sealAfterTicks>60</sealAfterTicks>
        <healPerSecond>4</healPerSecond>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_FlamePassives">
        <strikeThermal>0.5</strikeThermal>
        <chainChance>0</chainChance>
        <chainRadius>4</chainRadius>
        <chainDamageFactor>0.4</chainDamageFactor>
        <chainTargets>3</chainTargets>
        <chainInterval>6</chainInterval>
        <maxCharge>3</maxCharge>
        <chargeDuration>600</chargeDuration>
        <killCooldownReduction>90</killCooldownReduction>
        <dancePerCharge>0.6</dancePerCharge>
        <heavenPerCharge>1</heavenPerCharge>
        <counterChance>0.5</counterChance>
        <counterCooldown>120</counterCooldown>
        <resistanceFactor>0</resistanceFactor>
        <thermalDamageDefs>
          <li>EH_Flame</li>
          <li>Flame</li>
          <li>Burn</li>
        </thermalDamageDefs>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_FlameAbilities">
        <severRange>10</severRange>
        <flashRange>15</flashRange>
        <danceRadius>6</danceRadius>
        <heavenRange>12</heavenRange>
        <severCooldown>300</severCooldown>
        <flashCooldown>360</flashCooldown>
        <danceCooldown>540</danceCooldown>
        <heavenCooldown>1350</heavenCooldown>
        <telegraphTicks>12</telegraphTicks>
        <staggerTicks>60</staggerTicks>
        <fistFloor>10</fistFloor>
        <explosionRadius>3</explosionRadius>
        <severPhysical>1.5</severPhysical>
        <severThermal>0.8</severThermal>
        <flashPhysical>2</flashPhysical>
        <flashThermal>1</flashThermal>
        <dancePhysical>1.5</dancePhysical>
        <danceThermal>1</danceThermal>
        <heavenPhysical>6</heavenPhysical>
        <heavenThermal>4</heavenThermal>
        <explosionThermal>1.5</explosionThermal>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_HellMastery" />
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_HellFlameIncarnate" />
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
